          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f7f7f7\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div><b>Emperor’s Vigor Tonic </b>is marketed as a men's wellness product intended to support male vitality, daily energy, stamina, and overall well-being. It is designed to appeal to adult men who want to maintain an active lifestyle and incorporate additional wellness support into their daily routine. Its actual effects depend on the product's ingredients, their dosages, and the available scientific evidence.</div><br><div><b><br></b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>1. Supports Daily Energy</b></span></div><div>Energy levels are influenced by nutrition, sleep, hydration, physical activity, and overall health. Emperor’s Vigor Tonic may be promoted for men seeking support for everyday vitality. However, its ability to improve energy levels depends on its verified formulation, and results cannot be guaranteed.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>2. Promotes Male Vitality</b></span></div><div>Male vitality is associated with several aspects of physical health, including adequate nutrition, regular exercise, and healthy lifestyle habits. Products like Emperor’s Vigor Tonic are marketed to complement these habits. The specific contribution of this product cannot be established without confirming its active ingredients.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>3. Aims to Support Stamina and Endurance</b></span></div><div>Stamina helps people maintain physical activity and manage everyday demands. A balanced diet, consistent exercise, and sufficient rest can contribute to endurance. Whether Emperor’s Vigor Tonic provides additional stamina benefits depends on its formula and supporting clinical research.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>4. Complements Men's Wellness</b></span></div><div>Men's wellness involves more than energy and physical performance. Maintaining a healthy weight, managing stress, getting adequate sleep, and eating nutrient-rich foods can contribute to overall well-being. A supplement may complement these habits but should not be considered a substitute for them.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>5. May Fit Into a Daily Routine</b></span></div><div>A tonic may offer a convenient way to take a supplement, depending on its formulation and directions. Anyone considering Emperor’s Vigor Tonic should follow the manufacturer's recommended serving instructions and review its ingredients for potential allergies or interactions with medications.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
