        {
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor"
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#f7f7f7\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Emperor’s Vigor Tonic</b> is marketed as a men’s wellness supplement featuring a blend of traditional botanicals. Its formula is designed to complement a healthy lifestyle and support general vitality, stamina, and everyday well-being. Here are some of the key benefits associated with its intended use.<br><br></p>                \n         </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_anchor": "content5-1k",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "v1XUQbpUqO",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#f7f7f7\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Supports Daily Energy–</b>&nbsp;Emperor’s Vigor Tonic is promoted for men who want to maintain their energy throughout the day. Combined with adequate sleep, balanced nutrition, and regular physical activity, a wellness routine may help support everyday energy levels.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Promotes Stamina and Vitality– </b>The product is marketed to support stamina and general vitality. Individual results can vary, and the complete formula has not been established as a clinically proven way to improve physical endurance.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Supports Men’s Overall Wellness – </b>Its blend of traditional botanical ingredients is intended to complement a broader approach to men’s health and wellness. It should be used alongside healthy daily habits rather than as a replacement for medical care.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Complements an Active Lifestyle – </b>Maintaining physical activity, eating nutritious foods, staying hydrated, and getting sufficient rest are important for overall fitness. Emperor’s Vigor Tonic is marketed as a supplement that may fit into such a routine.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Features Traditional Herbal Ingredients – </b>The formula includes botanicals used in traditional herbal practices, such as schisandra, cistanche, and rehmannia. Traditional use does not automatically establish that these ingredients deliver specific benefits when combined in this product.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Offers a Convenient Supplement Routine – </b>For adults who prefer a packaged supplement, the product provides a convenient format for following the manufacturer’s recommended serving instructions. Always follow the directions on the current label.</span></li></ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
